---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import "../../styles/education-news.css";
---
<BaseLayout title="Education & News | Coming Soon" description="Education and News is coming to AI in Perspective. Curated learning resources and thoughtful AI news coverage are being planned." bodyClass="exhibit-body">
  <SiteHeader subtle />
  <main class="en-soon" id="content" data-en-soon>
    <div class="en-sky" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <section class="en-hero" aria-labelledby="en-title">
      <a class="en-back" href="/discover/">← All perspectives</a>
      <div class="en-hero__grid">
        <div class="en-hero__copy">
          <p class="en-eyebrow"><span class="en-live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> PERSPECTIVE 05 / BUILD IN PROGRESS</p>
          <h1 id="en-title">Education <span>&amp;</span> News</h1>
          <p class="en-pixel-headline">COMING <span>SOON</span><span class="en-blink" aria-hidden="true">_</span></p>
          <p class="en-lead">There's more to explore, and we want to get it right. We're gathering useful ways to learn about AI and working out how to bring you news with the sources and context you deserve.</p>
          <div class="en-hero__actions">
            <a class="en-primary" href="#arcade">See the arcade break <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <a class="en-quiet" href="#what-is-next">What's coming <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="en-progress"><span aria-hidden="true">▰▰▰▱▱▱▱▱▱▱</span> Still assembling the good stuff</p>
        </div>
        <div class="en-hero__signal" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="en-hero__signal-orbit en-hero__signal-orbit--a"></div>
          <div class="en-hero__signal-orbit en-hero__signal-orbit--b"></div>
          <div class="en-hero__signal-core"><span>?</span></div>
          <span class="en-hero__signal-bit en-hero__signal-bit--a"></span>
          <span class="en-hero__signal-bit en-hero__signal-bit--b"></span>
          <span class="en-hero__signal-bit en-hero__signal-bit--c"></span>
          <span class="en-hero__signal-caption">NEW CONTENT LOADING</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="en-arcade" id="arcade" aria-labelledby="en-arcade-title">
      <div class="en-section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="en-eyebrow en-eyebrow--pink">A LITTLE ARCADE INTERMISSION</p>
          <h2 id="en-arcade-title">While we build, enjoy the show.</h2>
          <p>Our next perspective is still taking shape. In the meantime, here's a retro pixel-fighter animation to keep the screen interesting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="en-arcade__mark" aria-hidden="true">★<span>05</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="en-arcade__cabinet">
        <div class="en-arcade__top"><span><span class="en-arcade__led" aria-hidden="true"></span> ARCADE MODE</span><span>AI IN PERSPECTIVE / 05</span></div>
        <iframe id="en-fighter" class="en-arcade__frame" title="Retro pixel-art fighter animation. Use the Replay animation button to start over." src="/arcade/education-news-fighter.html" loading="eager" tabindex="-1" sandbox="allow-scripts" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe>
        <div class="en-arcade__bottom">
          <p>A short animated fighter combo. Click inside the scene to replay it, or use the button.</p>
          <button type="button" class="en-replay" data-en-replay><span aria-hidden="true">↻</span> Replay animation</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="what-is-next" class="en-next" aria-labelledby="en-next-title">
      <div class="en-next__heading">
        <p class="en-eyebrow">TWO THINGS WE'RE WORKING TOWARD</p>
        <h2 id="en-next-title">The real content comes next.</h2>
        <p>This is a temporary stop while we choose the resources and figure out the best way to cover AI news.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="en-next__cards">
        <article class="en-next__card en-next__card--learn">
          <div class="en-next__card-top"><span class="en-next__number">01 / EDUCATION</span><span class="en-next__stamp">PLANNED</span></div>
          <span class="en-next__glyph" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
          <h3>Learn something useful.</h3>
          <p>Clear explanations, practical guides, and carefully chosen resources for anyone who wants to understand AI better. We're collecting and reviewing the material before putting it here.</p>
          <span class="en-next__small">LESS NOISE / MORE UNDERSTANDING</span>
        </article>
        <article class="en-next__card en-next__card--news">
          <div class="en-next__card-top"><span class="en-next__number">02 / NEWS</span><span class="en-next__stamp">PLANNING</span></div>
          <span class="en-next__glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
          <h3>Follow the news. Keep the context.</h3>
          <p>We're exploring an RSS-based news feed. The aim is to link back to original reporting, show when something was published, and help you understand why it matters.</p>
          <span class="en-next__small">RSS IS A PLAN / NO LIVE FEED YET</span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="en-next__footnote">No lessons or live headlines are being presented here yet. This page will change as the content and sourcing approach are ready.</p>
    </section>
    <footer class="en-footer"><span>AI IN PERSPECTIVE · EDUCATION & NEWS / COMING SOON</span><a href="/discover/">Explore the other perspectives <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></footer>
  </main>
  <script>
    const replayButton = document.querySelector("[data-en-replay]");
    const fighterFrame = document.getElementById("en-fighter");
    if (replayButton && fighterFrame) {
      let playNumber = 0;
      replayButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
        playNumber += 1;
        fighterFrame.setAttribute("src", "/arcade/education-news-fighter.html?replay=" + playNumber);
      });
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
